   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;d like to have a button in a shiny app that restores all the widgets to default values--e.g. all sliders shift to the minimum value. Is there a way? A fair bit of searching turned up nothing. I&#39;ve noticed that you cannot simply redefine the input values on the server side.</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
